  "description": "Isu is betrayed, robbed of everything, and finally murdered by her husband Taegang, who was having an affair with her own stepmother. But when Isu opens her eyes again, she finds herself on her wedding day, seven years in the past. This time, she refuses to be anyone’s victim. Determined to take revenge, she joins hands with Jeonghyeok, a man who offers a contract marriage as the price for playing the role of her ex-boyfriend. As Isu’s revenge and hidden pasts unfold, will they be able to keep their calculated relationship as nothing more than an emotionless agreement?\n\n_Source: Line Webtoon_\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=851667), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14246965)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[English](https://www.webtoons.com/en/drama/revenge-with-my-new-husband/list?title_no=11010), [French](https://www.webtoons.com/fr/romance/revenge-with-my-new-husband/list?title_no=11034), [Indonesian](https://www.webtoons.com/id/romance/revenge-with-my-new-husband/list?title_no=11147), [T.Chinese](https://www.webtoons.com/zh-hant/romance/revenge-with-my-new-husband/list?title_no=10949), [Thai](https://www.webtoons.com/th/romance/revenge-with-my-new-husband/list?title_no=10996)",
